### What happens if sender sends negative amount
### Sender generates ghost money and debited to receiver, and maybe
### MILLONS of negative balance for the receiver and MILLONS for sender
###
POST {{CoreBankingWebApplication_HostAddress}}/api/BalanceTransaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "SenderBankAccountId": 1,
    "ReceiverBankAccountId": 1,
    "Amount": 400.0
}

